Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:22:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat(05-01): answer and groundedness contract models

CitationRecord, AnswerGroundedness, AnswerFeedback(Request), AnswerRecord,
GroundednessRequest/Result/Thresholds with the D-01/D-11/D-13 rules, plus the
default 0.5 thresholds file. Registration tests follow in the next commit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X342shLsAZx6PYph2vA7hc
